  "result": "I made the fixes for all five reports. I haven't run the test suite or a type check, so the changes are unverified.\n\n- **Comment count:** `countComments` in `comment-repository.ts` now excludes archived comments.\n- **Deleting a comment:** the `comment.deleted` listener in `search-service.ts` now removes the `comment` document, not an `issue` one, so only that comment leaves search.\n- **Archiving an issue:** the `issue.archived` listener also removes every comment of that issue from search, using a new `listCommentIdsForIssue` in `comment-repository.ts`. Other issues and workspaces are untouched.\n- **Rebuild:** `search-reindex-job.ts` now does the following:\n  - clears the org's existing search documents first (new `deleteAllSearchDocuments` in `search-repository.ts`), so deleted or archived content does not come back and reruns do not duplicate results;\n  - pages through every live project and live issue instead of reading only the first 100;\n  - indexes only live comments, still including live replies under a deleted parent.",
